---
source: tests/help_snapshots.rs
---
List a run's property (assertion) results.

Each property has its ID, name, group, and status: passing, failing, or undetermined. An undetermined property has not triggered yet. Each property also counts its examples and its counterexamples.

Filter by status with `passing`, `failing`, and `undetermined`. Give more than one to show each of those statuses.

Narrow with `name` and/or `group`. Both are case-insensitive substring matches against the relevant fields.

Examples:
  runs_properties {"run_id": "<run_id>", "failing": true}
  runs_properties {"run_id": "<run_id>", "failing": true, "undetermined": true}

Each property prints as one JSON object on its own line.
